// ── Liveness classification ────────────────────────────────────────────────

/**
 * Classify the head's dispatched-run state from one probeDispatchedState
 * bundle ({ active, verdict, green, newest }).
 *
 *   'running'          — a live run exists (queued/in_progress/waiting/
